{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795154255412898002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dear-advanced-azurevase","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e5e2e4d3522ecf36d2c6d6efca5ae02166479862f3bb2fcd373d9d181666808d","event_uuid":"4fe6df4f-511a-4947-9936-7158c4fcf3ea","position":{"commit_sha":"cb3c102f5ad9cd9b8151a5cfd80084e7f090efcf","position":"1795154199330193001-4fe6df4f-511a-4947-9936-7158c4fcf3ea"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"0fabff6636ab1c1815fd00b13f5ab633d8a2b3ce909c1dafc92cb1ef73dd2174","event_uuid":"e2a42013-ecf7-4895-93f4-188f9cc6eff7","position":{"commit_sha":"b125ac874a2b9455da25996baf04c1a46d3ae952","position":"1795154230250677001-e2a42013-ecf7-4895-93f4-188f9cc6eff7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"8f16cc3fb8bf270ddde3592a11b5aa9931d9b2dca8197ccb8411b8d2bba281f5","event_uuid":"b9e0e65a-7b69-4d95-9843-53060dd3f16d","position":{"commit_sha":"1470f7af2734b3ec5d8b3252294c35c110c2ae98","position":"1795154255412898001-b9e0e65a-7b69-4d95-9843-53060dd3f16d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795154199330193001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"e2a42013-ecf7-4895-93f4-188f9cc6eff7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8aa0-2120-5ef3-4750"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nDiscovered while triaging breezy-hogged-mastiff, which owns `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/unclassified.args`. These 20 entries move to `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/locale-tests.args`, which this bug owns.\n\nThese test modules read Markdown, YAML and Terraform from the checkout with `read_text()` and no `encoding` (for example `tests/unit/test_rebar_debug_step7_class_review.py:29,34`, `test_code_review_ws2.py:176`, `test_gate_scratch_volume_aa40.py:163-234`). On Windows that decodes UTF-8 files as cp1252. Under `LC_ALL=en_US.ISO8859-1 PYTHONUTF8=0` on macOS all 20 fail even with the `src/rebar` encoding fix of dogtired-blank-fieldmouse applied; ruff `PLW1514` (preview) reports 228 such reads in 108 test files.\n\nEvidence: Windows runs on throwaway branch `tmp/w05-remeasure` with origin/main `717c50f8b33` code plus a selection-only workflow change: run 44665461131 (the 242 `unclassified.args` entries; 48 passed, 194 failed or errored) and run 44681457334 (the 194, xdist, JUnit XML with full tracebacks). Both 2026-11-19 PST.\n\nModules:\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_recommend_overlays.py` (1)\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_surface_parity.py` (1)\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_ws2.py` (1)\n- `tests/unit/test_gate_scratch_volume_aa40.py` (3)\n- `tests/unit/test_makefile_worktree.py` (2)\n- `tests/unit/test_measurement_provenance_criterion.py` (4)\n- `tests/unit/test_rebar_debug_step7_class_review.py` (7)\n- `tests/unit/test_s4_prompt_cutover_edge.py` (1)\n\n## Approach\nName `encoding=\"utf-8\"` on the test-side reads, and guard the tests tree (for example enabling `PLW1514` for `tests/`). Remove each line from `locale-tests.args` as it passes.\n\n## Scope\nTest or product code for the listed modules, plus `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/locale-tests.args` (remove each fixed line; delete the file and its `@` reference in `.github/workflows/test.yml` once empty).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every line removed from `locale-tests.args` names a test that passed in a `sweep (windows)` run on main after the fix (run id recorded in a comment).\n- [ ] `locale-tests.args` is empty and deleted with its reference in `.github/workflows/test.yml`, or each remaining line names a test recorded on this ticket as intentionally unsupported on Windows with the reason.\n","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":".github/windows-sweep-deselect/locale-tests.args","reason":"remove each line as its test is fixed"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"4955-1705-4a36-4763","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep: 20 tests read repo text files with the locale codec","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4fe6df4f-511a-4947-9936-7158c4fcf3ea","e2a42013-ecf7-4895-93f4-188f9cc6eff7","b9e0e65a-7b69-4d95-9843-53060dd3f16d"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795154255412898002,"uuid":"03e9461d-2911-42ce-ad22-0c888624578c"}
